Procedure add_copied takes count as integer and variadic parameters returns integer:
    Start variadic arguments after count.
    Copy variadic arguments to saved.
    Declare first as integer with value Next variadic argument as integer.
    Declare second as integer with value Next variadic argument from saved as integer.
    Finish variadic arguments copy saved.
    Finish variadic arguments.
    Return first plus second.
End procedure.

Say Call add_copied with 2, 7, 35 done.
